  "details": "Creating new public instances via \"Invite Me\" to private worlds seems unintended, because neither the VRChat Client (2025.4.2, build 1768) nor website allow creating public instances of private worlds.\n\nReproduction: Create a new group or grab an existing group's ID (I used a now-deleted grp_6102d838-c02d-44d2-a953-0c2211d025ab). Grab a world's ID. Craft an unlocked invite URL manually by hand. Invite yourself with \"Invite Me\" to create a public instance.\n\n- https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_67fcaf00-4330-4534-9974-10a0e9b6fc3b&instanceId=BUGREPORT~group(grp_6102d838-c02d-44d2-a953-0c2211d025ab)~groupAccessType(public)~region(eu)\n\n- https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_67fcaf00-4330-4534-9974-10a0e9b6fc3b&instanceId=28058~region(eu)\n\nThe API should've disallowed creating public/group public instances of private worlds, or both the VRChat client & website should allow this behavior.",
